  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "MORE Markets is a lending and onchain capital allocation protocol that enables users to deposit assets into vaults for yield generation and leverage. It integrates with external DeFi protocols like Aave, Curve, and Uniswap to optimize capital efficiency.",
    "relationship_narrative": "The MORE Vaults family uses a Diamond proxy pattern where VaultsFactory creates vault instances and VaultsRegistry tracks them. Core logic is composed via MoreVaultsComposer and VaultFacet, while protocol integrations (Aave, Curve, Uniswap) are handled by dedicated facets, all governed by AccessControlFacet and ConfigurationFacet.",
